  "id": "descriptive-approach",
  "term": "descriptive approach",
  "definition": "In this packet, a descriptive approach means a qualitative research method used to gather and summarize people’s reported perceptions and behaviors, here through interviews with healthcare providers. It focuses on describing what participants say rather than testing a treatment or theory.",
